# This app currently reads no environment variables at runtime.
#
# When you add one:
#   - Client-readable values MUST use the VITE_ prefix (Vite only exposes those).
#   - Anything without the VITE_ prefix stays out of the browser bundle.
#   - NEVER put a secret in a VITE_ variable — the whole bundle is public.
#   - Read env in one place and validate it at startup (CONVENTIONS.md §12),
#     rather than scattering `import.meta.env` through components.
#
# Example:
# VITE_SITE_URL="https://dimasadimo.com"
